\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Son of God, if Thy free grace
\par Again  hath raised me up,
\par Called me still to seek Thy face,
\par And given me back my hope;
\par Still Thy timely help afford,
\par And all Thy loving- kindness show:
\par Keep me, keep me, gracious Lord,
\par And never let me go!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. By me, O my Saviour, stand
\par In sore temptation's hour;
\par Save me with Thine outstretched hand,
\par And show forth all Thy power;
\par O be mindful of Thy word,
\par Thy all- sufficient grace bestow:
\par Keep me, keep me, gracious Lord,
\par And never let me go!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Give me, Lord, a holy fear,
\par And fix it in my heart,
\par That I may from evil near
\par With timely care depart;
\par Sin be more than hell abhorred;
\par Till Thou destroy the tyrant foe,
\par Keep me, keep me, gracious Lord,
\par And never let me go!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Never let me leave Thy breast,
\par From Thee, my Saviour, stray;
\par Thou art my Support and Rest,
\par My true and living Way;
\par My exceeding great Reward,
\par In heaven above and earth below:
\par Keep me, keep me, gracious Lord,
\par And never let me go!
\par                            Amen. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

